Package: ocypus-a40
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: FatihSenturk <11239001+FatihSenturk@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-hid, python3-psutil, systemd, udev, adduser
Homepage: https://github.com/FatihSenturk/ocypus-a40-linux
Description: CPU temperature display for the Ocypus Iota A40 cooler
 Community Linux driver with automatic CPU sensor selection, scoped USB
 permissions and an automatically started systemd service.
 Tested on Ubuntu 24.04 with an AMD CPU and the Iota A40 USB display.
